# Audited: Counts's entry, Count 3 and Count 0 are the three cycles, by D6 as ruled (the fuel is a `Nat` and `-?` shrinks it, so the shrink check clears the loop and its turns are one unit of work, not cycle points); 3 turns of += 2 give 6.
# The guarded loop's tests: declarations of sem-ch07-while-guard.prism (Semantics chapter 6).

test the_guard_ends_the_loop, @Shown 3:
    build
    compute until idle
        => expect Ui.Label(text="6 0")
